WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.409
Large pretrained models in vision and language
point a way forward: they learn general

00:00:05.489 --> 00:00:08.345
representations self-supervised from raw data,

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:10.579
then transfer with little labeling.

00:00:10.659 --> 00:00:16.515
The authors ask whether reframing spike analysis as
generative prediction can likewise scale,

00:00:16.595 --> 00:00:19.770
fuse modalities, and transfer to behavior decoding.
